## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
## .NET / Visual Studio / C++ / Python - MARS Project Standard

# ============================================
# Nested repositories - ignore .git in subdirs
# Add subdirectory paths below if they contain separate git repos
# ============================================
**/.git/
**/.git

